OL,3,GNEWSATour de France expected to create
OL,4,Acycling 'buzz'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Tour de France 2027 route has been
OL,7,Frevealed, with riders set to pass
OL,8,Fthrough St Helens, Knowsley and
OL,9,FLiverpool.
OL,11,FCycle shop manager Matthew Porter said
OL,12,Fhe hoped the race would create a "buzz"
OL,13,Fin the area and inspire more people to
OL,14,Ftake up cycling.
OL,16,FPorter, from Evans Cycles in St Helens,
OL,17,Fsaid young people seeing some of the
OL,18,Fworld's best riders competing on roads
OL,19,Fclose to home could encourage them to
OL,20,Ftry different types of cycling.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,407,400,260,160,0,100
