OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSATour de France expected to create
OL,4,Acycling 'buzz'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"A lot of people actually have the
OL,7,Fwrong type of bike for what they use it
OL,8,Ffor. Our youth mainly ride mountain
OL,9,Fbikes, but seeing top athletes riding
OL,10,Froad bikes may cause them to try
OL,11,Fsomething different," he said.
